  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of project management system in the activities of state bodies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main aim of the project is to improve the quality of public administration and the extent to which key aspects of project management are embedded in the activities of state bodies. One of the key objectives of the project is to increase the motivation of project staff to develop professional competencies and introduce best practices in project management and to develop project maturity in the country as a whole.</narrative>
  </description>
